    {
      "bbox": [
        141,
        1224,
        1901,
        1441
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "On March 1st I appointed a Citizens' Fact-Finding Committee to advise the City on the merits of the jurisdictional dispute that had affected construction on City Hospital projects. They were requested to analyze and report to me the practices that prevail in private industry with reference to the unloading and distributing of furniture to be used in new buildings.",
