    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        141,
        1480,
        1947,
        1740
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "The Citizens' Committee composed of Peter Eller, Chairman of Board of Governors of the Building Trades Employers' Association; Max Foley, Engineer and Partner in firm of Voorhees, Walker, Foley and Smith and John J. Brennan, Secretary-Treasurer of the Building and Construction Trades Council, who all have wide experience in the building and construction field, held extensive hearings and conducted a thorough examination of the private building industry in town.",
